                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The Economic Cooperation Administration, through December 31, 1948, made
                    procurement authorizations of commodities and services totaling $145,700,000 for
                    Greece and $1,700,000 for Turkey. (<hi rendition="#italic">Third Report to
                        Congress of the Economic Cooperation Administration</hi>, Washington,
                    Government Printing Office, 1949, page 134.)</p>
            </div>
